   {
    "h": "Opening Weekend Performance",
    "p": [
     "The spy-comedy Udta Teer, starring Ayushmann Khurrana and Sara Ali Khan, registered a decent opening in Indian theatres on Friday, according to Hindustan Times. On its opening day, the film collected ₹4.10 crore domestically as reported by trade figures.",
     "Despite facing competition from holdover releases like Nayyi Navelli and Prahaar, the film showed growth on its second day. According to Sacnilk data cited in the report, Udta Teer added ₹7 crore on its second day, bringing its total domestic collection to ₹11.10 crore."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Trade Reactions and Outlook",
    "p": [
     "Trade analyst Taran Adarsh noted on X that the film performed better than pre-release estimates. While morning and noon shows experienced a slow start pointing toward an opening around ₹2.50 crore, evening and night screenings picked up significantly.",
     "Adarsh highlighted that the film's performance in urban centres could support a respectable weekend haul, with Saturday and Sunday figures remaining crucial for its theatrical run."
    ]
   }
