  "body": [
   {
    "h": "Second Weekend Box Office Rebound",
    "p": [
     "The Tamil film Jailer 2 demonstrated renewed momentum during its second weekend at the domestic box office. According to updates attributed to Sacnilk in Hindustan Times, the Rajinikanth-starrer collected ₹20.29 crore net in India on its second Saturday, rebounding after a dip during the preceding weekdays.",
     "The latest figures elevate the film's cumulative domestic net box office collection to ₹369.14 crore following its tenth day in theatres. Earlier in its theatrical run, the feature finished its first week with ₹334.35 crore net domestically."
    ]
